        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rimedio che rianima un Pokémon esausto\ne gli restituisce metà dei suoi PS massimi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A medicine that can be used to revive a single\nPokémon that has fainted. It also restores half of\nthe Pokémon’s max HP.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ひんしに　なった　ポケモン\n１匹を　元気に　したうえで\nＨＰを　半分まで　回復する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能让１只陷入濒死的\n宝可梦重获生机，\n并回复一半ＨＰ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Medicina que revive a un Pokémon debilitado y le\ndevuelve la mitad de sus PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
